 "structural_change": "Fresh source-bound six-slot stream engine native32. Unique SPIPE6 native and wrapper master names; no old 539 view alias. Same 1666.667 ps engine clock, route1540. Three/four macro columns preserve >=20 um channels and enlarge west standard-cell band for six pipeline stages. Mapping source999bf9c2, native raw load32 PASS; mapped cold/physical qualification remain pending. D+3 issue, D+9 first isolated write, six inflight slots and drain costs remain unadopted.",
